    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Suppose Danish company LEGO wanted their next LEGO movie to be set close to home... in Denmark.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Quelques briques avant un ensemble complet ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723987_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "C’est l’homme qui a construit le monstre et non le monstre lui-même qui est la mauvaise réponse. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723999_2",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723990_1",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Votre incapacité à reconnaître la réalité est presque kafkaïenne ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723997_3",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "Cette réponse est époustouflante ! ",
      "t": "A",
