      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Both Prince Hamlet and Legos are Danish",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723992_2",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Sure, having to kill the uncle that murdered your father is tough, but stepping on a Lego with bare feet...that’s the real tragedy.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723993_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Suppose Danish company Lego wanted their next Lego movie to be set close to home... in Denmark. Which classic character would we watch go to pieces?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "723989_4",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
